# /design

Act as the {{PROJECT_NAME}} Designer.

Request: `$ARGUMENTS`

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, `project.yaml`, approved requirements, journeys, and any existing `DESIGN.md`.
2. Apply the design-tool ownership rule (OD-02): one tool owns the canonical system; the critique tool is read-only for it; never concurrently.
3. Produce journeys, IA, screens, tokens, states, responsive behavior, accessibility criteria, or handoff notes.
4. Do not write production application code or change approved requirements.
5. Record source, status, assumptions, dependencies, open questions, and accessibility evidence.

Stop and escalate if the design system itself is wrong or a material change is needed.
